❯ we have the new project, start with first PRDs help me done it, must follow   
  rules in file Project_Rule.md                                                 
  Product Requirements Document (PRD)                                           
  Mini-React — Vietnam Mega-Sale Flash Sale Simulator                           
  Project Overview                                                              
  Project Name: Vietnam Mega-Sale Simulator                                     
  Domain: E-commerce flash sales inspired by Shopee and Lazada 11.11 campaigns  
  Architecture: Existing Mini-React + Vanilla JavaScript + CSS                  
  Development Method: Incremental implementation with atomic Conventional       
  Commits                                                                       
  Minimum Commits: 8                                                            
  Required Audit Artifact: AI_FAILURE_AUDIT.md                                  
                                                                                
  1. Project Objective                                                          
  Build an interactive e-commerce flash-sale simulation that demonstrates       
  accurate countdown timing, temporary inventory reservations, lock expiration, 
  checkout transitions, and robust handling of asynchronous state changes.      
                                                                                
  The application simulates a Vietnam Mega-Sale campaign in which a limited     
  quantity of products becomes available at a scheduled sale time. Users can    
  monitor the countdown, reserve a product, complete checkout before the        
  reservation expires, or lose their reservation when the lock expires.         
                                                                                
  The project must demonstrate three core engineering principles:               
                                                                                
  Zero-Drift Timer: Calculate remaining time using the actual wall-clock time   
  from Date.now() rather than relying on repeated interval decrements.          
                                                                                
  Optimistic Inventory Lock: Implement a finite state machine (FSM) that        
  manages reservations, expiration, and checkout while preventing invalid       
  transitions and overselling within the simulation's authoritative state.      
                                                                                
  AI Failure Mode Audit: Critically evaluate AI-generated implementation        
  suggestions and document at least three concrete flaws in                     
  AI_FAILURE_AUDIT.md.                                                          
                                                                                
  The implementation must extend the existing Mini-React project and preserve   
  its current rendering, state-management, and event-delegation architecture.   
                                                                                
  2. Global Project Rules                                                       
  2.1 Existing Architecture                                                     
  Before implementing each milestone:                                           
                                                                                
  Inspect the repository and identify the actual files responsible for state    
  management, rendering, events, and application initialization.                
                                                                                
  Reuse the existing Mini-React functions and conventions.                      
                                                                                
  Do not assume that main.js, index.js, or other files exist unless verified.   
                                                                                
  Do not replace the existing Mini-React engine with React, Vue, or another     
  framework.                                                                    
                                                                                
  Avoid unnecessary dependencies.                                               
                                                                                
  2.2 Semantic HTML                                                             
  Use semantic elements such as main, header, section, h1, p, button, and       
  output where appropriate.                                                     
                                                                                
  Avoid unnecessary generic wrapper elements and excessive DOM nesting.         
                                                                                
  All interactive controls must be keyboard-accessible and provide clear        
  accessible names.                                                             
                                                                                
  2.3 Atomic Commits                                                            
  Each milestone must result in one focused commit using the Conventional       
  Commits specification.                                                        
                                                                                
  The repository must contain at least eight distinct commits for this task. Do 
  not squash the required milestones into one commit.                           
                                                                                
  2.4 Scope and Simulation Boundaries                                           
  This is a front-end simulation unless the existing project already provides a 
  backend.                                                                      
                                                                                
  Inventory reservations must be consistent within the application's            
  authoritative in-memory simulation state. A client-side implementation alone  
  cannot guarantee inventory consistency across multiple users, browsers, or    
  devices.                                                                      
                                                                                
  Do not describe the simulation as a production-ready payment or distributed   
  inventory system.                                                             
                                                                                
  PRD 1 — T-01: Mega-Sale Project Foundation                                    
  Git Commit                                                                    
  feat(sale): establish mega-sale simulation foundation                         
                                                                                
  1.1 Objective                                                                 
  Establish the initial Mega-Sale application structure, define the campaign    
  configuration, and create the basic product and sale-status interface.        
                                                                                
  This milestone prepares the application for timer and inventory functionality 
  without implementing the complete sale workflow.                              
                                                                                
  1.2 Functional Requirements                                                   
  FR-01: Campaign Configuration                                                 
  Create a centralized configuration for the simulated sale campaign.           
                                                                                
  It must define:                                                               
                                                                                
  Campaign name.                                                                
                                                                                
  Product name.                                                                 
                                                                                
  Original price.                                                               
                                                                                
  Discounted sale price.                                                        
                                                                                
  Initial inventory quantity.                                                   
                                                                                
  Campaign start timestamp.                                                     
                                                                                
  Reservation lock duration.                                                    
                                                                                
  Use a single, documented time unit for timestamps and lock durations. Use     
  Unix epoch milliseconds for JavaScript timestamps.                            
                                                                                
  Use configurable sample data rather than scattering sale-specific constants   
  throughout the codebase.                                                      
                                                                                
  FR-02: Product Display                                                        
  Render a product card containing:                                             
                                                                                
  Product name.                                                                 
                                                                                
  Original price.                                                               
                                                                                
  Discounted price.                                                             
                                                                                
  Available inventory.                                                          
                                                                                
  Campaign status.                                                              
                                                                                
  Primary action button.                                                        
                                                                                
  The UI must distinguish the original price from the sale price using both     
  visual styling and accessible text.                                           
                                                                                
  FR-03: Campaign Status                                                        
  Support the initial campaign statuses:                                        
                                                                                
  UPCOMING                                                                      
                                                                                
  LIVE                                                                          
                                                                                
  ENDED                                                                         
                                                                                
  The status must be derived from the configured campaign schedule and current  
  time, rather than manually changed in multiple unrelated places.              
                                                                                
  FR-04: Initial Application State                                              
  Initialize the application with a valid configuration and a visible product   
  card.                                                                         
                                                                                
  The application must not crash if configuration values are invalid. Validate  
  essential fields and display a useful error or safe fallback.                 
                                                                                
  1.3 Acceptance Criteria                                                       
                                                                                
  The Mega-Sale page renders through the existing Mini-React engine.            
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Campaign configuration is centralized.                                        
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Product details and prices are visible.                                       
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Campaign status is derived from the configured schedule.                      
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Initial inventory is represented by a non-negative integer.                   
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Semantic HTML and accessible controls are used.                               
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Existing application functionality remains intact.                            
                                                                                
  1.4 Out of Scope                                                              
  Accurate countdown updates.                                                   
                                                                                
  Inventory reservation logic.                                                  
                                                                                
  Checkout processing.                                                          
                                                                                
  AI failure audit.                                                             

