❯ go on with 2 PRDs                                                             
  PRD 2 — T-02: Zero-Drift Millisecond Countdown                                
  Git Commit                                                                    
  feat(timer): implement zero-drift sale countdown                              
                                                                                
  2.1 Objective                                                                 
  Implement a countdown that accurately displays the remaining time until the   
  campaign starts or ends.                                                      
                                                                                
  The timer must derive remaining time from Date.now() and the fixed target     
  timestamp. It must not calculate the remaining duration by repeatedly         
  subtracting a fixed amount on every interval callback.                        
                                                                                
  2.2 Functional Requirements                                                   
  FR-01: Calculate Remaining Time                                               
  For a future target timestamp, calculate the remaining duration using:        
                                                                                
  remainingMs = Math.max(0, targetTimestamp - Date.now())                       
                                                                                
  The target timestamp must remain fixed for the lifetime of the countdown      
  unless the campaign schedule is explicitly changed.                           
                                                                                
  FR-02: Update the Display                                                     
  Use a scheduled callback, such as setInterval() or requestAnimationFrame(),   
  to refresh the visible countdown.                                             
                                                                                
  The callback must recalculate the remaining duration from the actual current  
  time on every update.                                                         
                                                                                
  Important: setInterval() may schedule UI refreshes, but it must not be the    
  source of truth for elapsed time.                                             
                                                                                
  FR-03: Display Millisecond Precision                                          
  Display the remaining duration in a format such as:                           
                                                                                
  HH:MM:SS.mmm                                                                  
                                                                                
  The formatting logic must:                                                    
                                                                                
  Handle durations longer than one hour.                                        
                                                                                
  Pad values with leading zeros where appropriate.                              
                                                                                
  Never display a negative duration.                                            
                                                                                
  Display 00:00:00.000 when the target is reached.                              
                                                                                
  Trigger a sale-status update when the target timestamp is reached.            
                                                                                
  FR-04: Handle Delayed Callbacks                                               
  The timer must remain correct if the browser delays callbacks because of:     
                                                                                
  A busy main thread.                                                           
                                                                                
  Background-tab throttling.                                                    
                                                                                
  Device sleep.                                                                 
                                                                                
  Temporary browser suspension.                                                 
                                                                                
  On the next update, the countdown must recalculate from the current           
  wall-clock time.                                                              
                                                                                
  FR-05: Manage Timer Lifecycle                                                 
  Avoid duplicate timer loops.                                                  
                                                                                
  Clear scheduled callbacks when the component or timer controller is disposed. 
                                                                                
  Avoid full application re-renders more frequently than necessary.             
                                                                                
  Keep countdown calculations separate from unrelated inventory state.          
                                                                                
  2.3 Acceptance Criteria                                                       
                                                                                
  The countdown displays millisecond precision.                                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Remaining time is derived from Date.now() and the fixed target timestamp.     
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Delayed callbacks do not accumulate timing drift.                             
                                                                                
                                                                                
  The timer never displays negative remaining time.                             
                                                                                
                                                                                
  The sale status changes when the target is reached.                           
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Reinitializing the timer does not create duplicate loops.                     
                                                                                
                                                                                
  All scheduled callbacks are cleaned up when no longer required.               
                                                                                
  2.4 Suggested Testing                                                         
  Configure a sale start time a few seconds in the future.                      
                                                                                
  Confirm that the countdown reaches zero and the sale becomes live.            
                                                                                
  Simulate a delayed callback or pause the browser tab.                         
                                                                                
  Confirm that the next update reflects the actual current time rather than a   
  stale decrement counter.                                                      
                                                                                
  PRD 3 — T-03: Inventory Reservation Finite State Machine                      
  Git Commit                                                                    
  feat(inventory): implement reservation state machine                          
                                                                                
  3.1 Objective                                                                 
  Implement an explicit finite state machine for product reservation.           
                                                                                
  The state machine must prevent invalid transitions, track temporary inventory 
  reservations, and establish a clear lifecycle for each simulated checkout     
  attempt.                                                                      
                                                                                
  3.2 Required Reservation States                                               
  Each reservation must have one of the following states:                       
                                                                                
  IDLE — no active reservation.                                                 
                                                                                
  RESERVING — a reservation request is being processed.                         
                                                                                
  LOCKED — inventory has been reserved temporarily.                             
                                                                                
  CHECKING_OUT — checkout validation is in progress.                            
                                                                                
  PURCHASED — checkout has completed successfully.                              
                                                                                
  EXPIRED — the reservation lock has expired.                                   
                                                                                
  CANCELLED — the reservation was cancelled.                                    
                                                                                
  These states describe an individual reservation, not the global campaign      
  status.                                                                       
                                                                                
  3.3 Functional Requirements                                                   
  FR-01: Define Explicit Transitions                                            
  Implement a centralized transition function that accepts the current state    
  and an event, validates the transition, and returns the next state or rejects 
  the operation.                                                                
                                                                                
  Expected transitions include:                                                 
                                                                                
  IDLE → RESERVING                                                              
                                                                                
  RESERVING → LOCKED                                                            
                                                                                
  RESERVING → IDLE when the request fails                                       
                                                                                
  LOCKED → CHECKING_OUT                                                         
                                                                                
  LOCKED → EXPIRED                                                              
                                                                                
  LOCKED → CANCELLED                                                            
                                                                                
  CHECKING_OUT → PURCHASED                                                      
                                                                                
  CHECKING_OUT → LOCKED when checkout fails but the reservation remains valid   
                                                                                
  CHECKING_OUT → EXPIRED when the lock expires before checkout can be accepted  
                                                                                
  The transition logic must reject invalid transitions, including attempts to   
  purchase an expired or cancelled reservation.                                 
                                                                                
  FR-02: Reservation Identity                                                   
  Each reservation must have a unique identifier and associated metadata,       
  including:                                                                    
                                                                                
  Product identifier.                                                           
                                                                                
  Reserved quantity.                                                            
                                                                                
  Creation timestamp.                                                           
                                                                                
  Expiration timestamp.                                                         
                                                                                
  Current reservation state.                                                    
                                                                                
  The reservation must not be represented by a single boolean such as isLocked. 
                                                                                
  FR-03: Inventory Accounting                                                   
  Maintain an explicit inventory model.                                         
                                                                                
  For a single-product simulation, track at least:                              
                                                                                
  Total inventory.                                                              
                                                                                
  Available inventory.                                                          
                                                                                
  Reserved inventory.                                                           
                                                                                
  Sold inventory.                                                               
                                                                                
  Enforce the invariant:                                                        
                                                                                
  total = available + reserved + sold                                           
                                                                                
  All quantities must be non-negative integers.                                 
                                                                                
  FR-04: Reserve Inventory                                                      
  When a user requests a reservation:                                           
                                                                                
  Confirm that the campaign is live.                                            
                                                                                
  Validate the requested quantity.                                              
                                                                                
  Verify sufficient available inventory.                                        
                                                                                
  Move the reservation into RESERVING.                                          
                                                                                
  Reserve inventory through the authoritative inventory controller.             
                                                                                
  Transition to LOCKED and record the expiration timestamp.                     
                                                                                
  If inventory is unavailable or the campaign is not live, reject the request   
  without changing inventory quantities.                                        
                                                                                
  FR-05: Reject Invalid Operations                                              
  The system must reject:                                                       
                                                                                
  Reservations for zero or negative quantities.                                 
                                                                                
  Reservations exceeding available inventory.                                   
                                                                                
  Reservations after the campaign ends.                                         
                                                                                
  Duplicate reservation operations that would reserve the same quantity twice.  
                                                                                
  Checkout attempts without a valid active reservation.                         
                                                                                
  3.4 Acceptance Criteria                                                       
                                                                                
  Reservation states and transitions are explicitly defined.                    
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Invalid transitions are rejected.                                             
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Every reservation has a unique identifier.                                    
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Inventory quantities remain non-negative.                                     
                                                                                
                                                                                
  The inventory accounting invariant holds after every accepted operation.      
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Failed reservations do not decrement available inventory.                     
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Only valid LOCKED reservations can proceed to checkout.                       
