  PRD 4 — T-04: Optimistic Inventory Lock and Expiry                            
  Git Commit                                                                    
  feat(inventory): add expiring inventory reservation locks                     
                                                                                
  4.1 Objective                                                                 
  Extend the reservation state machine with temporary inventory locks.          
                                                                                
  When a user reserves a product, the corresponding quantity must remain        
  unavailable to other reservation attempts until the lock expires, is          
  cancelled, or is converted into a completed purchase.                         
                                                                                
  4.2 Functional Requirements                                                   
  FR-01: Create a Reservation Lock                                              
  When a reservation succeeds:                                                  
                                                                                
  Record a unique reservation ID.                                               
                                                                                
  Record the lock creation timestamp.                                           
                                                                                
  Calculate the lock expiration timestamp.                                      
                                                                                
  Move the reserved quantity from available inventory into reserved inventory.  
                                                                                
  Display the remaining reservation time.                                       
                                                                                
  Use a configurable lock duration suitable for the simulation, such as five    
  minutes.                                                                      
                                                                                
  FR-02: Calculate Lock Expiry                                                  
  Determine whether a lock is valid using its absolute expiration timestamp.    
                                                                                
  The validity check must use the actual current time. It must not depend       
  exclusively on a decrementing countdown.                                      
                                                                                
  A reservation is no longer eligible for checkout once its expiration time has 
  been reached.                                                                 
                                                                                
  FR-03: Release Expired Inventory                                              
  When a lock expires:                                                          
                                                                                
  Verify that the reservation is still LOCKED.                                  
                                                                                
  Confirm that the expiration timestamp has been reached.                       
                                                                                
  Transition the reservation to EXPIRED.                                        
                                                                                
  Release its reserved quantity back into available inventory.                  
                                                                                
  Update the UI.                                                                
                                                                                
  Ensure that the same reservation cannot release inventory again.              
                                                                                
  Expiry handling must be idempotent. Repeated expiry checks must not increase  
  available inventory more than once.                                           
                                                                                
  FR-04: Prevent Stale Lock Actions                                             
  A delayed expiry callback must not expire a reservation that has already been 
  purchased, cancelled, or replaced by another reservation.                     
                                                                                
  Every expiry operation must verify both reservation identity and current      
  state.                                                                        
                                                                                
  FR-05: Handle Cancellation                                                    
  When a user cancels an active lock:                                           
                                                                                
  Transition the reservation to CANCELLED.                                      
                                                                                
  Release its reserved inventory exactly once.                                  
                                                                                
  Prevent subsequent checkout attempts using that reservation.                  
                                                                                
  FR-06: Coordinate Concurrent Operations                                       
  Within the simulation's authoritative inventory controller, reservation,      
  expiry, cancellation, and checkout transitions must be processed as           
  indivisible synchronous operations or through an equivalent serialized        
  command queue.                                                                
                                                                                
  The controller must validate the current state immediately before changing    
  inventory quantities.                                                         
                                                                                
  Do not implement separate UI handlers that independently decrement or         
  increment invento                                                             
  ──── (460 lines hidden) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── 
  mmit.                                                                         
                                                                                
  8.3 Acceptance Criteria                                                       
                                                                                
  The complete sale workflow works end to end.                                  
                                                                                
                                                                                
  The countdown remains accurate after delayed updates.                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Inventory accounting invariants hold throughout the workflow.                 
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Lock expiry and checkout transitions behave correctly.                        
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Automated tests pass.                                                         
                                                                                
                                                                                
  AI_FAILURE_AUDIT.md contains at least three verified AI failure modes.        
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Setup and test instructions are documented.                                   
                                                                                
                                                                                
  The Git history contains at least eight atomic Conventional Commits.          
                                                                                
                                                                                
  Existing Mini-React functionality remains intact.                             
                                                                                
  9. Required Git Commit Plan                                                   
  The project must contain at least eight commits, implemented in this order.   
                                                                                
  No.    Milestone    Conventional Commit                                       
  1    Project foundation    feat(sale): establish mega-sale simulation         
  foundation                                                                    
  2    Zero-drift countdown    feat(timer): implement zero-drift sale countdown 
  3    Reservation state machine    feat(inventory): implement reservation      
  state machine                                                                 
  4    Expiring inventory locks    feat(inventory): add expiring inventory      
  reservation locks                                                             
  5    Checkout workflow    feat(checkout): implement reservation checkout      
  workflow                                                                      
  6    Integration and race-condition fixes    fix(sale): prevent timer and     
  inventory state inconsistencies                                               
  7    Automated tests and audit    test(sale): add invariant tests and AI      
  failure audit                                                                 
  8    Final verification and documentation    docs(sale): finalize mega-sale   
  verification and documentation                                                
  Each commit must contain only the files and changes needed for its milestone. 
  If a milestone exposes a defect in an earlier feature, correct it in the      
  relevant later commit without rewriting unrelated work.                       
                                                                                
  10. Final Definition of Done                                                  
  The project is complete when:                                                 
                                                                                
  The simulated Vietnam Mega-Sale campaign operates from a configurable         
  schedule.                                                                     
                                                                                
  The countdown recalculates time using Date.now() and does not accumulate      
  interval-based drift.                                                         
                                                                                
  Inventory reservations follow an explicit finite state machine.               
                                                                                
  Reservation locks expire based on absolute timestamps.                        
                                                                                
  Expired inventory is released exactly once.                                   
                                                                                
  Checkout validates reservation identity, state, and expiry.                   
                                                                                
  Inventory quantities remain internally consistent.                            
                                                                                
  Automated tests cover critical timer, state-machine, and inventory edge       
  cases.                                                                        
                                                                                
  AI_FAILURE_AUDIT.md documents at least three verified AI failure modes.       
                                                                                
  At least eight discrete Conventional Commits are present.                     
                                                                                
  The existing Mini-React architecture remains functional.                      
                                                                                
  The project clearly documents that its client-side inventory simulation is    
  not a production distributed inventory system.                                

