      415 +                                                              
      416 +## T-05 — Checkout workflow and reservation finalization      
      417 +                                                              
      418 +Commit: `feat(checkout): implement reservation checkout workfl
          +ow`                                                           
      419 +                                                              
      420 +| File | Change |                                             
      421 +| --- | --- |                                                 
      422 +| `source/reservationStore.js` | `checkout(id)`: eligibility c
          +hecks, `LOCKED → CHECKING_OUT`, simulated payment (`processChe
          +ckout`), then purchase or failure; deduplicated by reservation
          + id; `purchasedAt` recorded |                                 
      423 +| `source/reservationMachine.js` | New error codes `already-pu
          +rchased`, `checkout-failed`, `not-eligible` |                 
      424 +| `source/productCard.js` | Checkout button (disabled unless L
          +OCKED, "Processing payment…" while CHECKING_OUT), total price,
          + purchase confirmation section |                              
      425 +| `source/mountMegaSale.js` | Checkout handler; announcements 
          +for every outcome; the confirmation follows store events |    
      426 +| `source/megaSale.demo.html` | "Simulate a failed payment" sw
          +itch (outside the simulator) that makes the 600 ms payment rej
          +ect |                                                         
      427 +                                                              
      428 +![Purchase confirmed](images/t05-purchased.png)               
      429 +                                                              
      430 +Key decisions:                                                
      431 +                                                              
      432 +- **Eligibility, all checked before CHECKING_OUT.** The reserv
          +ation exists                                                  
      433 +  (`not-found`). It is not purchased (`already-purchased`), ca
          +ncelled                                                       
      434 +  (`invalid-transition`) or expired. It is LOCKED and `now < e
          +xpiresAt`                                                     
      435 +  (a due lock is expired on the spot: `reservation-expired`). 
          +Its quantity                                                  
      436 +  is a positive whole number covered by reserved stock. It bel
          +ongs to this                                                  
      437 +  campaign's product and was created during the sale (`not-eli
          +gible`).                                                      
      438 +  The public API cannot create a reservation that fails the la
          +st two                                                        
      439 +  checks; they are defensive and not covered by a test.       
      440 +- **Campaign rule.** A lock made during the sale stays valid a
          +fter the                                                      
      441 +  sale ends, until its own expiry. The campaign end does not v
          +oid reserved                                                  
      442 +  stock (PRD 6 FR-01), and a test checks out 1 s after the end
          +.                                                             
      443 +- **One logical operation.** `completeCheckout` re-checks the 
          +expiry, then                                                  
      444 +  validates the transition, moves reserved → sold and applies 
      445 +  `CHECKING_OUT → PURCHASED` synchronously. A payment that ret
          +urns after                                                    
      446 +  `expiresAt` therefore ends `EXPIRED` with the stock released
          + once, and                                                    
      447 +  nothing is sold.                                            
      448 +- **Failed payment.** `CHECKING_OUT → LOCKED` with the units s
          +till                                                          
      449 +  reserved; the expiry timer is re-armed for the original expi
          +ry. The error                                                 
      450 +  is `checkout-failed` with the payment error as `cause`, and 
          +the shopper                                                   
      451 +  can try again before the lock runs out. A failure after the 
          +lock ran out                                                  
      452 +  ends `EXPIRED`, not LOCKED.                                 
      453 +- **Duplicate submissions.** `checkout(id)` keeps the promise 
          +of a checkout                                                 
      454 +  in progress per reservation id; further calls get the same p
          +romise, so                                                    
      455 +  there is one payment and one sale. After the purchase, anoth
          +er call is                                                    
      456 +  refused with `already-purchased`. In the UI the Checkout but
          +ton is also                                                   
      457 +  disabled the moment the state becomes CHECKING_OUT. A mutati
          +on that                                                       
      458 +  leaves it enabled still sells only once, because the store d
          +eduplicates.                                                  
      459 +- **No cancel during payment.** `CHECKING_OUT` has no CANCEL t
          +ransition;                                                    
      460 +  the payment's outcome decides the stock.                    
      461 +- **Feedback.** The live region reports "Processing payment fo
          +r 2 units…",                                                  
      462 +  "Purchase confirmed: 2 units for 1.598.000 ₫.", "Checkout fa
          +iled: The                                                     
      463 +  payment did not go through. Your reservation is still held, 
          +so you can                                                    
      464 +  try again before it expires.", "Checkout failed: Your reserv
          +ation expired                                                 
      465 +  …", "Your reservation expired…" (timer) and "Reservation can
          +celled…". The                                                 
      466 +  reservation panel shows the state ("Checking out…") and the 
          +total. After                                                  
      467 +  a purchase, a "Purchase confirmed" section (order, quantity,
          + total paid,                                                  
      468 +  time) stays until the next reservation request. It is driven
          + by the                                                       
      469 +  store's `CHECKOUT_SUCCEED` event, not by the click handler. 
      470 +                                                              
      471 +Tests: `source/megaSale.test.html` — 105/105 passed (headless 
          +Edge 155). Nine                                               
      472 +store tests cover: the full checkout; ineligible reservations 
          +(unknown,                                                     
      473 +cancelled, already purchased, expired at `expiresAt`) with no 
          +stock change;                                                 
      474 +checkout after the campaign ends; three rapid submissions retu
          +rning one                                                     
      475 +promise with one payment and one sale; a failed payment return
          +ing to LOCKED                                                 
      476 +with stock reserved and the timer re-armed, then a successful 
          +retry; a lock                                                 
      477 +expiring during payment; a failed payment after the lock ran o
          +ut; no                                                        
      478 +cancel mid-payment; and purchased units surviving sweeps and l
          +ate timers.                                                   
      479 +Every store change is checked against the invariant. Five UI t
          +ests cover                                                    
      480 +progress, the disabled button and confirmation; rapid clicks; 
          +failure and                                                   
      481 +retry; checkout outliving the lock; and the confirmation clear
          +ing on the                                                    
      482 +next reservation.                                             
      483 +                                                              
      484 +Demo check (`?scenario=live`): reserving and checking out show
          +s "Purchase                                                   
      485 +confirmed" with Sold 1. With the failed-payment switch on, the
          + reservation                                                  
      486 +stays LOCKED and the live region explains that it is still hel
          +d. There are                                                  
      487 +no console errors.                                            
      488 +                                                              
      489 +Mutation checks (each made tests fail, then the code was resto
          +red):                                                         
      490 +                                                              
      491 +| Mutation | Failing tests |                                  
      492 +| --- | --- |                                                 
      493 +| No deduplication of checkout by reservation id | 1 |        
      494 +| `completeCheckout` does not re-check the expiry | 3 |       
      495 +| Failed payment always returns to LOCKED | 1 |               
      496 +| Stock committed before the transition is validated | 2 |    
      497 +| Checkout button stays enabled while CHECKING_OUT | 1 |      

