      23  
      24 +## Architecture                                                
      25 +                                                               
      26 +Data flows one way: the **clock** and **user actions** go into 
         +the                                                            
      27 +**reservation store**; the store changes reservations and stock
         + and                                                           
      28 +notifies; the **mount** re-renders the card from the store's sn
         +apshots                                                        
      29 +with Mini-React. Nothing in the UI changes stock itself.       
      30 +                                                               
      31 +| Subsystem | Files | Responsibility |                         
      32 +| --- | --- | --- |                                            
      33 +| Campaign configuration | `source/saleConfig.js` | One frozen 
         +config: names, `productId`, prices (whole đồng), stock, `starts
         +At` / `endsAt` (epoch ms), `lockDurationMs`, time zone. `valida
         +teSaleConfig` lists every problem instead of throwing; `createS
         +ampleConfig(now)` builds the demo sale |                       
      34 +| Campaign status | `source/saleStatus.js` | `getCampaignStatus
         +(config, now)` → UPCOMING / LIVE / ENDED, derived each time, ne
         +ver stored |                                                   
      35 +| Countdown controller | `source/countdown.js` | `formatDuratio
         +n` (HH:MM:SS.mmm), `remainingMs`, `createCountdown`: one `setIn
         +terval` per countdown; every update computes `target − now()`, 
         +so there is no drift; fixed targets; `onReached` once per targe
         +t |                                                            
      36 +| Reservation state machine | `source/reservationMachine.js` | 
         +The 7 states, 8 events and the frozen table of 9 allowed transi
         +tions; `transition()` rejects everything else; `ReservationErro
         +r` codes |                                                     
      37 +| Inventory controller | `source/inventory.js` | `total = avail
         +able + reserved + sold` in non-negative integers; `reserve` / `
         +release` / `commit` move units between buckets and assert the i
         +nvariant |                                                     
      38 +| Reservation store (authority) | `source/reservationStore.js` 
         +| The single place that changes reservations and stock: `reserv
         +e`, lock expiry (one timer per lock, `expireIfDue`, `sweepExpir
         +ed`), `cancel`, and the checkout workflow `checkout(id)` (eligi
         +bility → CHECKING_OUT → payment → PURCHASED / LOCKED / EXPIRED,
         + deduplicated by id). Each operation validates and writes synch
         +ronously |                                                     
      39 +| Checkout workflow | `source/reservationStore.js` (`checkout`,
         + `beginCheckout`, `completeCheckout`, `failCheckout`); UI in `s
         +ource/productCard.js` and `source/mountMegaSale.js` | Converts 
         +a valid lock into a purchase exactly once; failed payments keep
         + the lock; expiry during payment releases once |               
      40 +| UI (Mini-React) | `source/productCard.js` (pure VNode builder
