      10 +idk man to be or not to be or sth im not a philosopher         
      11 +                                                               
      12 +## Vietnam Mega-Sale Simulator (`LAB2/HW/megasale/`)           
      13 +                                                               
      14 +A front-end simulation of an 11.11 flash sale (Shopee / Lazada 
         +style),                                                        
      15 +built on this repository's Mini-React core (`LAB2/HW/source/`).
         + A                                                             
      16 +campaign opens on a schedule; shoppers reserve units, which are
         + locked for                                                    
      17 +a few minutes, and check out before the lock expires or lose it
         +.                                                              
      18 +                                                               
      19 +### Run it                                                     
      20 +                                                               
      21 +No build step and no dependencies. Serve the `LAB2/` folder, so
         + the                                                           
      22 +`../../source/` imports resolve:                               
      23 +                                                               
      24 +```                                                            
      25 +cd LAB2                                                        
      26 +python -m http.server 8765                                     
      27 +```                                                            
      28 +                                                               
      29 +- Demo: http://localhost:8765/HW/megasale/source/megaSale.demo.
         +html. The                                                      
      30 +  links at the top switch scenarios (upcoming, starts in 5 s, l
         +ive, live                                                      
      31 +  with a 20 s lock, ended, invalid configuration). A switch bel
         +ow the card                                                    
      32 +  makes the simulated payment fail.                            
      33 +- Tests: http://localhost:8765/HW/megasale/source/megaSale.test
         +.html. 126                                                     
      34 +  in-browser tests run on load; the line at the top shows how m
         +any passed.                                                    
      35 +  The other suites still pass too: `HW/source/dataGrid.test.htm
         +l`,                                                            
      36 +  `HW/audio/source/audio.test.html`, and `EXERCISE/sources/*.te
         +st.html`.                                                      
      37 +                                                               
      38 +### Important decisions                                        
      39 +                                                               
      40 +- **Zero-drift countdown.** Remaining time is always           
      41 +  `Math.max(0, target − Date.now())`; the interval only schedul
         +es                                                             
      42 +  refreshes, so delayed callbacks never cause drift (`countdown
         +.js`).                                                         
      43 +- **Explicit state machine.** Reservations follow one frozen tr
         +ansition                                                       
      44 +  table (IDLE, RESERVING, LOCKED, CHECKING_OUT, PURCHASED, EXPI
         +RED,                                                           
      45 +  CANCELLED); every other move is rejected (`reservationMachine
         +.js`).                                                         
      46 +- **One authority for stock.** `reservationStore.js` is the onl
         +y code that                                                    
      47 +  changes reservations and stock, keeping                      
      48 +  `total = available + reserved + sold`. Each operation validat
         +es and                                                         
      49 +  writes synchronously. Locks expire against their absolute `ex
         +piresAt`,                                                      
      50 +  exactly once, and stale timer callbacks are ignored. Checkout
         + re-checks                                                     
      51 +  the expiry and is deduplicated by reservation id.            
      52 +- **UI derived from the store.** The Mini-React card re-renders
         + from store                                                    
      53 +  snapshots on changes, never per countdown tick. Status change
         +s are                                                          
      54 +  announced in one live region, and disabled actions explain wh
         +y.                                                             
      55 +                                                               
      56 +Full write-up, architecture table and per-milestone notes:     
      57 +`LAB2/HW/megasale/report.md`. AI failure audit: `AI_FAILURE_AUD
         +IT.md`.                                                        
      58 +                                                               
      59 +### Limitations                                                
      60 +                                                               
      61 +This is a client-side simulation. Stock is consistent only insi
         +de one                                                         
      62 +page's in-memory store; two tabs or devices do not share it. It
         + is not a                                                      
      63 +production payment or distributed inventory system: that needs 
         +server-side                                                    
      64 +atomic reservations, durable records and transactions.         
      65   No newline at end of file

